# JustDubit LTX-2 Completion Plan

We are pushing through the final weight setup to get the real LTX-2 pipeline running.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **HuggingFace Gating:** The Gemma model previously selected is "gated," requiring a HuggingFace account and manual approval/login. To bypass this "getting stuck," I will attempt to use a non-gated text encoder or ask you to provide an `HF_TOKEN` if no alternative is possible.

## Proposed Changes

### [Component Name] Weight Download & Verification
Summary: Resume the download of all required assets. Verify that the files already on disk are valid.

#### [MODIFY] [download_weights.py](file:///c:/just-dub-it/scripts/download_weights.py)
- Add smarter verification of existing file sizes.
- Switch to a non-gated Gemma model if possible (e.g., `google/gemma-3-4b-it` if unrestricted, or similar) to avoid 401 errors.
- Add more detail on progress (actual MB/s) to the terminal.

### [Component Name] Syncthing Integration
Summary: Check if Syncthing has the files we need.

- If Syncthing at `localhost:8384` shows synchronized folders with models, we will symlink them instead of downloading.

